msgid "toc.messages.help.status_definitions"
msgstr ""
"PENDING = Your service ticket has been successfully created, and a technician will be assigned shortly to begin the investigation.\n"
"IN PROGRESS = Your service ticket is currently being investigated by our technical team. Diagnostic and resolution activities are underway.\n"
"SUSPENDED = Your service ticket is temporarily on hold pending additional actions or information. This status may apply when access to the equipment is unavailable or when a solution has been implemented and requires a monitoring period before further action.\n"
"SOLVED = A solution has been identified and implemented. The reported issue has been resolved.\n"
"CLOSED = After the problem is SOLVED, the solution has been reviewed and validated by our Service team. The ticket is formally closed."

